ub.com/godotengine/godot/issues/85989#issuecomment-1853055823, free and replace the rid of TextureRD instead of using `RenderingServer.texture_replace`. And clean the unnecessary `notify_property_list_changed` because the property list never changes.\r\n\r\n~After this PR, `texture_rd_rid` won't be freed automatically, and you always need to free `texture_rd_rid` use `RenderingDevice.free_rid` manually.~ Already so.\r\n\r\nIn addition, this PR will aggravate #95273. The texture will become completely white in ShaderMaterial whenever its rid changes, unless you set the shader parameter again","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-02-21T06:37:38Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T16:13:47Z","closed_at":"2025-07-29T16:14:34Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c66da919a820df6025763c1fdcfea6e0111c606c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"beicause:texturerd-recreate-rid-when-set","ref":"texturerd-recreate-rid-when-set","repo":{"id":773063339,"node_id":"R_kgDOLhQCqw","name":"godot","full_name":"beicause/godot","owner":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/be